{"4917040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hungry Hungry Human", "steam_appid": 4917040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hungry Hungry Human is a social deduction game set inside a supermarket.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player is secretly the <i>Hungry Hungry Human</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has tasks to do: customers shop, the cleaner cleans, security checks shelves and searches customers, the cashier restocks, and the manager keeps everyone busy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>But someone is eating the products.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch people carefully, complete your role tasks, and figure out who is acting suspiciously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discuss, vote, and catch Hungry Hungry Human to win the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Social deduction gameplay in a supermarket setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play as different roles with different tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- One hidden Hungry Human causing chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Funny supermarket interactions like eating, smuggling, counting, cleaning, and managing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Offline bot support planned for the demo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer planned for the full game</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hungry Hungry Human is a social deduction game set inside a supermarket.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player is secretly the <i>Hungry Hungry Human</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has tasks to do: customers shop, the cleaner cleans, security checks shelves and searches customers, the cashier restocks, and the manager keeps everyone busy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>But someone is eating the products.</u>